    <a href="#%e7%ae%80%e4%bb%8b" class="header-mark"></a>简介</h2><p><a href="/posts/%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/point/github/">github</a> 的 <a href="/posts/%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/point/CICD/">CICD</a> 工具名字叫 <code>action</code>,而 <a href="/posts/%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/point/gitea/">gitea</a> 采用了兼容的方式. 因为 github 肯定会经常用到, 而以后私人也可以使用 gitea, 所以记录一下使用方法.</p>
<p>代码放在这里, 可以 fork 练习一下. <a href="https://github.com/kentxxq/learn-actions" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub - kentxxq/learn-actions</a></p>]]></description></item><item><title>CICD</title><link>https://kentxxq.com/posts/%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/point/cicd/</link><pubDate>Sat, 22 Jul 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author><name>kentxxq</name></author><guid>https://kentxxq.com/posts/%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/point/cicd/</guid><description><![CDATA[<p><code>cicd</code> 是持续集成 (Continuous Integration)-CI 和持续交付 (Continuous Delivery)-CD 的缩写. 属于 <a href="/posts/%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/point/devops/">devops</a> 的一部分.</p>]]></description></item></channel></rss>